  "description": "The Vitus Dee 29 is an aluminium, smooth-rolling, big-wheel urban bike with a 7-speed Shimano drivetrain.\n\nThe geometry supports a comfortable, upright riding position, making it a great option for commuting or cruising around town.\n\nThis utility bike features mechanical disc brakes and 160mm rotors front and rear for reliable stopping power. It has a 7 speed Shimano drivetrain with a single chainring to keep things nice and simple for easy maintenance.\n\nThe large, quick release 29er wheels provide efficient rolling over rough roads and off-road trails. WTB Nano tyres provide just the right amount of grip for tackling almost anything you can throw at them, whilst still having a tarmac friendly rolling resistance for effort-free cruising\n\nUtility cycling at its best.",
